\section{Preprocessing}
Only columns with at least 80\% numeric completeness in the training fold were retained,
yielding 87 inputs. Non-finite values were imputed with training-fold medians. Means and
standard deviations were then fitted on the purged training fold only and applied
unchanged to validation and test. Constant-scale safeguards replace standard deviations
below \(10^{-8}\) with one. Targets are deterministically serialized as
\VAR{summary.target_transform|latex} to 12 decimal places from exact upstream float32
observations. The canonical values must remain within \(2\times10^{-6}\) log10 units of
the upstream TaskApi output.

All models use context length 32. The MLP reads the final feature vector in each context;
Strata-OT reads the full ordered context. Persistence predicts the previous observed
test target, with the final training target used only for the first test endpoint.
Climatology is the training-fold target median.

\section{Model architectures and optimization}
\subsection{Compact MLP baseline}
The MLP has four 1024-wide fully connected blocks, each with GELU and dropout 0.1,
after input layer normalization. A probabilistic head emits Gaussian location and
hard-clamped log scale plus ordered 0.1/0.5/0.9 quantiles. It has 3,244,211 parameters
and no climatology residual.

\subsection{Strata-OT Surface}
Strata-OT Surface projects 87 features to width 192, adds learned positions, and applies
six pre-norm Transformer encoder layers with six attention heads and four-times-width
feed-forward blocks. A four-expert differentiable regime mixture is followed by learned
temporal attention pooling, output normalization, and the same probabilistic head. The
location is a residual around the training-fold climatology median. It has 3,331,768
parameters.

\subsection{Loss and trainer}
Neural training minimizes Gaussian negative log likelihood plus 0.20 times quantile
pinball loss. AdamW uses learning rate 0.0003 and weight decay 0.01 with cosine annealing,
BF16 mixed precision, gradient clipping at 1.0, batch size 128, and gradient accumulation
of 2. Validation RMSE controls the best checkpoint and early stopping (patience 12,
maximum 80 epochs). Deterministic algorithms, highest float32 matmul precision, and
math-only scaled dot-product attention were enforced. The Windows worker probe selected
zero effective data-loader workers.

